---
import Container from '../components/ui/Container.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About RM Industries and our approach to building useful software.">
  <Container size="md" class="py-16 sm:py-24 lg:py-28">
    <article class="prose mx-auto">
      <div class="text-primary mb-6 font-mono text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.16em] uppercase">About RM Industries</div>
      <h1 class="text-[clamp(3rem,7vw,5rem)] leading-none tracking-[-0.055em]">Small, useful software for problems worth solving.</h1>
      <p class="lead">RM Industries is an independent software company built around a simple idea: pay attention to the points of friction people accept every day, then make something better.</p>

      <h2>How we work</h2>
      <p>We look for specific, meaningful pain points and shape focused products around them. Projects stay private while they are exploratory. When something is ready to stand on its own, we share it here.</p>

      <h2>What we’re building</h2>
      <p>Our current public project is Forge, an opinionated Astro starter for building modern, content-driven websites with sensible defaults and production-ready automation.</p>

      <p>
        See <a href="https://github.com/rm-industries" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">our work on GitHub</a>
        {' '}or email{' '}<a href="mailto:rahul@rm-industries.com">rahul@rm-industries.com</a>.
      </p>
    </article>
  </Container>
</BaseLayout>
